# Git configuration to protect audio, video, and image binaries from corruption

# Audio files (Binary - never modify line endings)
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.m4a binary
*.flac binary
*.aac binary

# Video files
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mov binary

# Image files
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text
*.ico binary

# Archives
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
